{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "We are adding email capture to accounts. Add an email field to the User model in app/models.py, and make sure the shared database schema is updated so the service works with the new field. apply-schema.sh in the repo applies the pending migration."}
